      "q": "10. In figure, A, B, C, D are four points on a circle. AC and BD intersect at a point E such that $\\angle {\\text{BEC}} = {130^\\circ }$ and $\\angle {\\text{ECD}} = {20^\\circ }$. Find $\\angle {\\text{BAC}}$.",
