      "q": "4.\nA rhombus shaped field has green grass for $$18$$ cows to graze. If each side of the rhombus is $30\\;{\\text{m}}$ and its longer diagonal is $48\\;{\\text{m}}$, grass of how much area of grass field will each cow be getting?",
