      "q": "6.\nA floral design on a floor is made up of 16 tiles which are triangular, the sides of the triangle being $9\\;{\\text{cm}},28\\;{\\text{cm}}$ and $35\\;{\\text{cm}}$ (see figure). Find the cost of polishing the tiles at the rate of $$50$$ paise per ${\\text{c}}{{\\text{m}}^2}$.",
