      "q": "47. A dome of a building is in the form of a hemisphere. From inside, it was whitewashed at the cost of Rs.$$498.96.$$If the cost of white-washing is at the rate of Rs.$$2.00$$ per square meter, find:\n(i) the inner surface area of the dome.",
