      "q": "14. It costs $${\\mathbf{Rs}}.{\\text{ }}{\\mathbf{2200}}$$to paint the inner curved surface of a cylindrical vessel $10\\;{\\text{m}}$ deep. If the cost of painting is at the rate of Rs. $${\\mathbf{20}}$$per ${{\\mathbf{m}}^2}$, find:\n(i) inner curved surface area of the vessel.",
