      "q": "33. A shot put is a metallic sphere of radius $4.9\\;{\\text{cm}}$ If the density of the metal is $7.8\\;{\\text{g}}$ per ${\\text{c}}{{\\text{m}}^3}$ Find the mass of the shot put.",
